The nktp chart declares third-party charts as dependencies rather than
vendoring them. Helm downloads them into nktp/charts/, which this repository
does not commit, and the packaged chart includes them. nktp/Chart.yaml and
nktp/Chart.lock name and pin every one of them:

    opentelemetry-kube-stack   open-telemetry/opentelemetry-helm-charts
    prometheus-node-exporter   prometheus-community/helm-charts
    metrics-server             kubernetes-sigs/metrics-server

nktp/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md lists these dependencies, the charts they bundle,
and their versions and licenses.
